<title>UK: BZ Bank sets warrants on Zurich Insurance.</title>
<headline>BZ Bank sets warrants on Zurich Insurance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZ Bank said it has issued three million American-style call warrants, on Zurich Insurance shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled bt 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    600 SFR		   ISSUE PRICE  3.70 SFR</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 31.JUL.97-17.DEC.97   PAYDATE	31.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  SPOT REF     583 SFR</p>
<p> NOTES	     </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
